  "title": {
   "en": "The Girl I Saved on the Train Turned Out to Be My Childhood Friend"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "Chikan Saresou ni Natteiru S-kyuu Bishoujo wo Tasuketara Tonari no Seki no Osananajimi datta"
   },
   {
    "zh": "从痴汉手中救下的S级美少女竟然是我的邻座的青梅竹马"
   },
   {
    "ja": "痴漢されそうになっているＳ級美少女を助けたら隣の席の幼馴染だった"
   },
   {
    "zh-hk": "從痴漢手中救下的S級美少女竟然是我的鄰座的青梅竹馬"
   },
   {
    "vi": "Cô gái tôi cứu trên chuyến tàu hóa ra lại là bạn thưở nhỏ ngồi bên cạnh"
   },
   {
    "en": "When I Rescued a Beautiful Girl Who Was About to Be Molested, It Was My Childhood Friend Sitting Next to Me"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Fushimi Hina is the most universally recognized S-class beauty in the school. She is a childhood friend of Ryo, but they hardly spoke to each other from junior high school, but when Ryou steps in to save a girl on a train, he doesn't expect her to be his childhood friend Hina. Will his heroic act inspire Hina to get closer to Ryou?",
   "pt-br": "Fushimi Hina é reconhecida na escola pela sua beleza classe S. Ela é amiga de infância de Ryou, mas eles raramente se falam desde o fundamental, mas quando Ryou salva uma garota em um trem, ele não esperava que fosse a sua amiga de infância Hina. Será que o seu ato heróico inspirará Hina a se aproximar dele?"
  },
